---
import ContentLayout from '../../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
import SetupHero from '../../components/SetupHero.astro';
import SetupScene from '../../components/SetupScene.astro';
---
<ContentLayout title="Gaming setups | StackGeist" description="Gaming and mixed-use desk setups built around real space, budget, and clutter constraints." active="setups">
  <p class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/setups">Setups</a> / Gaming</p>
  <p class="page-kicker">Gaming setups</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">Gaming setups that still work as actual desks.</h1>
  <p class="page-lead">Start with the room, desk space, and gear you already have. Then add only what improves the setup.</p>
  <SetupHero src="/setups/gaming.png" alt="Illustration of a practical mixed-use gaming and work desk with a screen bar and one accent light" />

  <section class="content-section split">
    <SetupScene />
    <div class="copy-panel">
      <p class="page-kicker">Featured setup</p>
      <h2>Midnight Shift</h2>
      <p>A dark gaming + work setup built for a smaller room, with controlled lighting and gear that earns its footprint.</p>
      <div class="facts">
        <div class="fact"><span>Good for</span><strong>Gaming · work · console</strong></div>
        <div class="fact"><span>Budget target</span><strong>About $700</strong></div>
        <div class="fact"><span>Priority</span><strong>Atmosphere without clutter</strong></div>
      </div>
      <div class="page-actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/setups/midnight-shift">View Midnight Shift →</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <p class="page-kicker">How we organize setups</p>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Constraints are more useful than aesthetics alone.</h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <a class="card" href="/setups/small-bedroom-gaming"><h3>Small spaces</h3><p>Layouts that protect usable desk depth and floor space before adding decorative gear.</p></a>
      <a class="card" href="/setups/budget-gaming-desk"><h3>Budget</h3><p>Build around a target spend and separate meaningful upgrades from things that can wait.</p></a>
      <a class="card" href="/setups/midnight-shift"><h3>Mixed use</h3><p>Gaming, school, and work share the same desk without forcing a complete reset between tasks.</p></a>
      <a class="card" href="/guides/cable-management"><h3>Low clutter</h3><p>Fewer visible cables, fewer objects fighting for surface area, and cleaner power routing.</p></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</ContentLayout>
